+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MyKHFrQyq7Cf834ZynuN2T","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Phase 12: Graceful Shutdown\n2\t\n3\tAdd the ability to shut down the task queue system in an orderly fashion.\n4\t\n5\t## Requirements\n6\t\n7\t- A shutdown operation should signal the system to stop accepting new tasks.\n8\t- After shutdown is initiated, attempting to add new tasks should produce an error.\n9\t- The shutdown should wait for all currently-processing tasks to finish, up to a configurable timeout.\n10\t- If processing tasks do not complete within the timeout, they should be force-cancelled.\n11\t- Callbacks can be registered to run during the shutdown process.\n12\t- The shutdown should produce a summary indicating how many tasks completed, how many were force-cancelled, and how long the shutdown took.\n13\t- Calling shutdown multiple times should be safe and return the same result.\n14\t- If no tasks are processing, shutdown should complete immediately.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"08a9ec0a-0f75-4e4d-a128-e9b53ab70ffc","uuid":"d51397e5-643b-4775-9884-08fcdc4dbbdd","timestamp":"2026-05-29T04:25:20.584Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/phases/phase-12.md","content":"# Phase 12: Graceful Shutdown\n\nAdd the ability to shut down the task queue system in an orderly fashion.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- A shutdown operation should signal the system to stop accepting new tasks.\n- After shutdown is initiated, attempting to add new tasks should produce an error.\n- The shutdown should wait for all currently-processing tasks to finish, up to a configurable timeout.\n- If processing tasks do not complete within the timeout, they should be force-cancelled.\n- Callbacks can be registered to run during the shutdown process.\n- The shutdown should produce a summary indicating how many tasks completed, how many were force-cancelled, and how long the shutdown took.\n- Calling shutdown multiple times should be safe and return the same result.\n- If no tasks are processing, shutdown should complete immediately.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}}}
