+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01P77w84WxauM63bgVsXpqmt","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Phase 4: Delayed and Scheduled Tasks\n2\t\n3\tAdd the ability to defer tasks so they only become available for processing after a specified time.\n4\t\n5\t## Requirements\n6\t\n7\t- A task can be given a delay (in milliseconds) or a specific future time at which it becomes available.\n8\t- Delayed tasks are added to the queue immediately but are not returned when retrieving until their availability time has passed.\n9\t- Non-delayed tasks are always preferred over delayed tasks that are not yet available.\n10\t- When multiple delayed tasks become available simultaneously, they should be ordered by availability time, then priority, then FIFO.\n11\t- The task object should indicate when it becomes available.\n12\t- Delays work correctly with named queues.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PxqJh5NHDEncaLvUnndaF5","session_id":"08a9ec0a-0f75-4e4d-a128-e9b53ab70ffc","uuid":"1a97061d-d713-460d-b434-6be10fa0297a","timestamp":"2026-05-29T04:26:57.345Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Read all phase and config files"}
+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0147fA7KS2XMPgrd186aqLu7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Phase 5: Retry with Backoff\n2\t\n3\tAdd automatic retry functionality so that failed tasks can be re-attempted with increasing delays.\n4\t\n5\t## Requirements\n6\t\n7\t- There should be a way to mark a processing task as completed or failed.\n8\t- When a task fails and has retries remaining, it is automatically re-added to the queue with a delay.\n9\t- The delay follows exponential backoff: `baseDelay * 2^(attempt - 1)` (e.g., 1s, 2s, 4s, ...).\n10\t- The default maximum number of retries is 3, but this should be configurable per task.\n11\t- The base backoff delay defaults to 1000ms but should be configurable per task.\n12\t- The task should track how many times it has been attempted.\n13\t- Retried tasks keep their original queue and priority.\n14\t- If all retries are exhausted, the task remains in a failed state.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PxqJh5NHDEncaLvUnndaF5","session_id":"08a9ec0a-0f75-4e4d-a128-e9b53ab70ffc","uuid":"9cd019d8-43a1-4974-9716-d3ed74af0dd1","timestamp":"2026-05-29T04:26:57.345Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Read all phase and config files"}
